the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    the calculation date is *a date*; scenario element.
    *a person* is qualifying immigration or nationality status for snap participation.
    the citizenship or nationality of *a person* qualifies for snap participation.
    *a person* is individual ineligible for snap participation due to residence or status.
    the individual income considered for household eligibility and allotment of *a person* is *an amount*.
    the individual financial resources considered for household eligibility and allotment of *a person* is *an amount*.
    *a person* is alien lawfully admitted for permanent residence as immigrant; scenario element.
    *a person* has been granted status of cuban and haitian entrant; scenario element.
    the person lawfully of *a person* resides in united states in accordance with compact of free association; scenario element.
    *a person* is citizen of united states; scenario element.
    *a person* is national of united states; scenario element.
    *a person* is member of household otherwise eligible to participate under this section; scenario element.
    *a person* is resident of united states; scenario element.
    the individual income of *a person* is *an amount*; scenario element.
    *a person* is state exercises income pro rata share option; scenario element.
    the income pro rata share of *a person* is *a rate*; scenario element.
    the individual financial resources of *a person* is *an amount*; scenario element.

the knowledge base us_statutes_7_2015_f includes:


% 7 U.S.C. 2015(f) — us:statutes/7/2015/f
the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)-(D)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/f.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/f.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(1)-(2)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/f.yaml".

the text of "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)" is at "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/f.yaml".

rule qualifying_immigration_or_nationality_status_for_snap_participation_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)-(D)":
a person is qualifying immigration or nationality status for snap participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the citizenship or nationality of the person qualifies for snap participation.

rule qualifying_immigration_or_nationality_status_for_snap_participation_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)-(D)":
a person is qualifying immigration or nationality status for snap participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person is alien lawfully admitted for permanent residence as immigrant.

rule qualifying_immigration_or_nationality_status_for_snap_participation_3 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)-(D)":
a person is qualifying immigration or nationality status for snap participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person has been granted status of cuban and haitian entrant.

rule qualifying_immigration_or_nationality_status_for_snap_participation_4 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)-(D)":
a person is qualifying immigration or nationality status for snap participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person lawfully of the person resides in united states in accordance with compact of free association.

rule citizenship_or_nationality_qualifies_for_snap_participation_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)":
the citizenship or nationality of a person qualifies for snap participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person is citizen of united states.

rule citizenship_or_nationality_qualifies_for_snap_participation_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(2)(A)":
the citizenship or nationality of a person qualifies for snap participation if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person is national of united states.

rule individual_ineligible_for_snap_participation_due_to_residence_or_status_1 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(1)-(2)":
a person is individual ineligible for snap participation due to residence or status if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person is member of household otherwise eligible to participate under this section
        and it is not the case that the person is resident of united states.

rule individual_ineligible_for_snap_participation_due_to_residence_or_status_2 with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)(1)-(2)":
a person is individual ineligible for snap participation due to residence or status if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person is member of household otherwise eligible to participate under this section
        and it is not the case that the person is qualifying immigration or nationality status for snap participation.

rule individual_income_considered_for_household_eligibility_and_allotment with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)":
the individual income considered for household eligibility and allotment of a person is an amount N if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person is individual ineligible for snap participation due to residence or status
        and the individual income of the person is an amount M
        and the person is state exercises income pro rata share option
            and the income pro rata share of the person is a rate R
            otherwise R = 0
        and a number K = M - R
        and the maximum of 0 and K is N
        otherwise the person is a person
        and N = 0.

rule individual_financial_resources_considered_for_household_eligibility_and_allotment with provenance "7 U.S.C. 2015(f)":
the individual financial resources considered for household eligibility and allotment of a person is an amount N if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-07-04 <= D
    and the person is individual ineligible for snap participation due to residence or status
        and the individual financial resources of the person is an amount M
        and the maximum of 0 and M is N
        otherwise the person is a person
        and N = 0.

